  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CB07131",
    "sub_id": "22341",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1.Mid-semester test1, test2 (40%) 2. attendance 5% Assignments 10% Quiz 10% 3. Final presentation (5%) and report (30%)</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>l<strong>Homework/presentation is due on date specified </strong></div>\n\n<div>No late submission will be accepted</div>\n\n<div>Students may discuss homework assignments, but every student must work on his/her own solutions.</div>\n\n<div>Final project is due on the last week of this semester.&nbsp; Further information will be announced in class.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Please download your lecture notes from ilearn2!</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div><strong>期末報告注意事項</strong></div>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>請採用逢甲大學圖書館優質學生報告WORD檔案繕打你們的報告。可以搜尋過去的相關的研究，但是請勿抄襲歷史的優質學生報告。</li>\n\t<li>請使用逢甲大學圖書館<strong>Turnitin</strong>論文原創性比對服務方式，<em>比對</em>文件稱為<em>相似度</em>報告，扣除參考文獻，相似度不得超過20%。</li>\n\t<li>請選擇合適的報告題目。在研究報告有效力的標題有幾個特點:</li>\n</ol>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>準確地顯示了研究主題和範圍 ;</li>\n\t<li>避免用縮寫，除非該所寫非常廣為人知 ;</li>\n\t<li>使用字創造積極的印象和激發讀者的興趣;</li>\n\t<li>使用當前命名法。</li>\n\t<li>標題是通常在一個短語的形式，但也可以是一個問題的形式, e.g. : Gold and the US dollar: Hedge or heaven? 很少論文題目是用驚嘆號。</li>\n</ol>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>報告長度不超過40頁為原則, 包括圖表及電腦輸出結果。內文內容，請用12號字體，中文字一律用標楷體，英文字一律用Times New Roman. 参數符號則用希臘字。段落請選擇最小行高，18pt.</li>\n\t<li>報告需要提供一頁摘要，在創建一個有效率摘要，請就本期末報告目的、使用的研究方法，評估準則，分析結果作一概述，無需分段。摘要需要簡潔，傳遞重要訊息。避免使用縮寫和<strong>公式</strong>。摘要在呈現你的文中簡短，清晰的總結。精心準備摘要使讀者能夠快速準確地識別的基本內容，以確定其關係到他/她的興趣或目的，然後決定是否要閱讀整篇文章。</li>\n\t<li>關鍵字扮演重要的角色，依本計畫性質自訂六個關鍵詞，譬如 診斷分析，選擇重要變數。</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "Being Punctual!\n(Three strikes and you are out)\nYou want to get out of here? You talk to me. \n(No discussion in private, unless you are allowed to do so)\nHomework/presentation is due on date specified \nNo late submission will be accepted\nStudents may discuss homework assignments, but every student must work on his/her own solutions.\nThe final project is due on the last week of this semester.  Further information will be announced in class.",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": "Please download your lecture notes from ilearn2!",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>Deliberate breaches of academic honesty constitute academic misconduct.違反學術誠實</div>\n\n<div>Plagiarism 抄襲，剽竊</div>\n\n<div>Fabrication of data</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;(e.g. <strong><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haruko_Obokata\">Haruko</a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haruko_Obokata\"> </a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haruko_Obokata\">Obokata</a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haruko_Obokata\">, </a></strong><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haruko_Obokata\">小保方晴子</a>, Obokata&#39;s mentor and co-author&nbsp;Yoshiki Sasai&nbsp;committed suicide; <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/science/2015/feb/18/haruko-obokata-stap-cells-controversy-scientists-lie\">It found that </a><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/science/2015/feb/18/haruko-obokata-stap-cells-controversy-scientists-lie\">Obokata</a><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/science/2015/feb/18/haruko-obokata-stap-cells-controversy-scientists-lie\"> had falsified and fabricated data</a>)</div>\n\n<div>Recycling previously submitted material再使用以前提交材料</div>\n\n<div>Engaging someone else to complete an assessment or exam on one&rsquo;s behalf 他人代勞作業考試或報告</div>\n\n<div>Misconduct during supervised assessments作業作弊</div>\n\n<div>The penalties for academic misconduct may include:</div>\n\n<div>A mark of zero on the assessment 作業零分</div>\n\n<div>A fail grade in the unit of study&nbsp; 成績不及格</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": null
